WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.686
The Six to Ten of Wands follow the fire
suit from recognition to overload.

00:00:05.686 --> 00:00:08.596
Each card has an upright and a reversed
meaning.

00:00:09.896 --> 00:00:10.672
Six of Wands.

00:00:10.672 --> 00:00:12.643
Recognition, victory, confidence.

00:00:12.643 --> 00:00:18.197
A rider wearing a laurel wreath moves through a
crowd, with a wand crowned by another wreath.

00:00:19.497 --> 00:00:20.489
Seven of Wands.

00:00:20.489 --> 00:00:23.993
Defending your position, perseverance,
standing firm.

00:00:23.993 --> 00:00:29.017
A figure on higher ground holds a wand
against six others rising from below.

00:00:30.317 --> 00:00:31.226
Eight of Wands.

00:00:31.226 --> 00:00:33.104
Speed, movement, news arriving.

00:00:33.104 --> 00:00:37.225
Eight wands fly diagonally through open
sky with no figure in sight.

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:41.052
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:41.052 --> 00:00:45.974
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
